    "detailed_description": "Let the bricks floating with the river touch your brick raft, and they will become new members.<br>There are many dangerous enemies in the river to stop your progress, and those towers from nowhere can help you defeat them.<br>As we all know, three one-star things can become two stars, three two-star things can become three stars, it's very simple.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548400/extras/e82a825b3d26ab1a699212ec2dd2761f.avif?t=1696637958\" /></span><br><br>There are two currencies in the game:<br>1 Gold coin is a temporary currency in the level, you can use it to strengthen your tower in the level, distribute it reasonably, and spend it as much as you want.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548400/extras/491a079df496995768c0c14674ff7a93.avif?t=1696637958\" /></span><br><br>2 diamonds can be used to permanently strengthen the skills of the tower, which is very precious.<br><br>Enemies in the game sometimes drop a lot of junk, and sometimes the dropped equipment is very useful.",
    "about_the_game": "Let the bricks floating with the river touch your brick raft, and they will become new members.<br>There are many dangerous enemies in the river to stop your progress, and those towers from nowhere can help you defeat them.<br>As we all know, three one-star things can become two stars, three two-star things can become three stars, it's very simple.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548400/extras/e82a825b3d26ab1a699212ec2dd2761f.avif?t=1696637958\" /></span><br><br>There are two currencies in the game:<br>1 Gold coin is a temporary currency in the level, you can use it to strengthen your tower in the level, distribute it reasonably, and spend it as much as you want.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548400/extras/491a079df496995768c0c14674ff7a93.avif?t=1696637958\" /></span><br><br>2 diamonds can be used to permanently strengthen the skills of the tower, which is very precious.<br><br>Enemies in the game sometimes drop a lot of junk, and sometimes the dropped equipment is very useful.",
